{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"nav":1},[2,31],{"label":3,"items":4},"Start",[5,21],{"title":6,"path":7,"headings":8},"Getting started","/docs/getting-started",[9,12,15,18],{"id":10,"text":11},"open-scratch","Open Scratch",{"id":13,"text":14},"add-five-numbers","Add five numbers",{"id":16,"text":17},"change-the-shortcuts","Change the shortcuts",{"id":19,"text":20},"choose-the-look-and-motion","Choose the look and motion",{"title":22,"path":23,"headings":24},"Keyboard Shortcuts","/docs/shortcuts",[25,28],{"id":26,"text":27},"switch-sheets","Switch sheets",{"id":29,"text":30},"nudge-a-number-or-date","Nudge a number or date",{"label":32,"items":33},"Guides",[34,113,129,166,182,192],{"title":35,"path":36,"headings":37},"Grid and shortcuts","/docs/grid",[38,41,44,47,50,53,56,59,62,65,68,71,74,77,80,83,86,89,92,95,98,101,104,107,110],{"id":39,"text":40},"grid-toolbar","Grid toolbar",{"id":42,"text":43},"move-and-select","Move and select",{"id":45,"text":46},"complete-a-formula","Complete a formula",{"id":48,"text":49},"select-separate-ranges","Select separate ranges",{"id":51,"text":52},"save-a-named-range","Save a named range",{"id":54,"text":55},"named-tables","Named tables",{"id":57,"text":58},"add-borders-or-style-a-table","Add borders or style a table",{"id":60,"text":61},"duplicate-a-sheet-or-import-a-file","Duplicate a sheet or import a file",{"id":63,"text":64},"insert-or-delete-rows-and-columns","Insert or delete rows and columns",{"id":66,"text":67},"move-hide-or-resize-rows-and-columns","Move, hide or resize rows and columns",{"id":69,"text":70},"freeze-rows-and-columns","Freeze rows and columns",{"id":72,"text":73},"sort-rows","Sort rows",{"id":75,"text":76},"filter-rows","Filter rows",{"id":78,"text":79},"resize-the-window","Resize the window",{"id":81,"text":82},"move-or-detach-panes","Move or detach panes",{"id":84,"text":85},"open-a-sheet-in-its-own-window","Open a sheet in its own window",{"id":87,"text":88},"drag-out-a-table-or-export-csv","Drag out a table or export CSV",{"id":90,"text":91},"copy-a-range-for-another-app","Copy a range for another app",{"id":93,"text":94},"workbooks-and-sheet-archive","Workbooks and sheet archive",{"id":96,"text":97},"tsv-and-excel-files","TSV and Excel files",{"id":99,"text":100},"preview-paste-and-fill","Preview paste and fill",{"id":102,"text":103},"format-a-range","Format a range",{"id":105,"text":106},"calculate-and-copy","Calculate and copy",{"id":108,"text":109},"work-across-sheets","Work across sheets",{"id":111,"text":112},"check-inputs-as-you-edit","Check inputs as you edit",{"title":114,"path":115,"headings":116},"Capture and paste","/docs/capture",[117,120,123,126],{"id":118,"text":119},"capture-amounts","Capture amounts",{"id":121,"text":122},"read-a-screenshot","Read a screenshot",{"id":124,"text":125},"choose-how-to-paste","Choose how to paste",{"id":127,"text":128},"fill-a-series","Fill a series",{"title":130,"path":131,"headings":132},"Notes and Obsidian","/docs/notes-and-obsidian",[133,136,139,142,145,148,151,154,157,160,163],{"id":134,"text":135},"move-notes","Move Notes",{"id":137,"text":138},"resize-notes","Resize Notes",{"id":140,"text":141},"format-a-note","Format a note",{"id":143,"text":144},"annotate-a-cell-or-range","Annotate a cell or range",{"id":146,"text":147},"put-a-live-result-in-a-note","Put a live result in a note",{"id":149,"text":150},"repair-a-note-link","Repair a note link",{"id":152,"text":153},"send-the-table-and-notes","Send the table and notes",{"id":155,"text":156},"save-a-dated-sheet-note","Save a dated sheet note",{"id":158,"text":159},"edit-a-table-in-both-scratch-and-obsidian","Edit a table in both Scratch and Obsidian",{"id":161,"text":162},"open-an-export-in-scratch","Open an export in Scratch",{"id":164,"text":165},"search-your-obsidian-vault","Search your Obsidian vault",{"title":167,"path":168,"headings":169},"Formula Microscope","/docs/formula-microscope",[170,173,176,179],{"id":171,"text":172},"read-a-calculation","Read a calculation",{"id":174,"text":175},"find-a-cell-behind-an-error","Find a cell behind an error",{"id":177,"text":178},"match-formula-references-to-the-grid","Match formula references to the grid",{"id":180,"text":181},"see-where-a-pinned-result-came-from","See where a pinned result came from",{"title":183,"path":184,"headings":185},"Selection History","/docs/history",[186,189],{"id":187,"text":188},"compare-a-revision","Compare a revision",{"id":190,"text":191},"restore-just-the-range","Restore just the range",{"title":193,"path":194,"headings":195},"Record and Replay","/docs/replay",[196],{"id":197,"text":198},"try-it-on-another-range","Try it on another range"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"prev":7,"next":10},{"title":2,"description":3,"html":4,"path":5,"group":6},"Formula Microscope","See how a formula evaluates and jump to the cells behind its result.","\u003Cp class=\"lead\">Select a formula cell and click ƒx in the formula bar. You can also choose Inspect Formula from the command palette.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"read-a-calculation\">Read a calculation\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#read-a-calculation\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Enter \u003Ccode>3\u003C/code> in A1 and \u003Ccode>5\u003C/code> in A2. Enter \u003Ccode>=SUM(A1:A2)*2\u003C/code> in B1 and inspect it. The microscope shows \u003Ccode>16\u003C/code> for the result, \u003Ccode>8\u003C/code> for the sum and \u003Ccode>2\u003C/code> for the multiplier. Click \u003Ccode>A1:A2\u003C/code> to select that range in the grid.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>An \u003Ccode>IF\u003C/code> formula shows which branch ran. Parts Scratch didn’t evaluate are marked \u003Cstrong>Not evaluated\u003C/strong>. A range shows how many cells it covers. Press Escape to close the microscope and keep the grid open.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Named ranges resolve to the cells they cover. For a cross-sheet reference, the microscope shows the sheet and address in the expression. Jump links are available for references on the current sheet. \u003Ca href=\"/docs/grid#work-across-sheets\">Work across sheets\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"find-a-cell-behind-an-error\">Find a cell behind an error\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#find-a-cell-behind-an-error\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Set A1 to \u003Ccode>0\u003C/code>, B1 to \u003Ccode>=12/A1\u003C/code> and C1 to \u003Ccode>=B1+1\u003C/code>. Inspect C1 to see the path through B1 to A1. Choose \u003Cstrong>Go to A1\u003C/strong> to jump to the zero divisor. For an error inside the formula itself, such as \u003Ccode>=1/0\u003C/code>, the microscope shows the failing step. A formula Scratch cannot parse shows the error above the expression.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"scratch-media\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-light\" src=\"/docs/formula-error-light.webp\" alt=\"The Formula Microscope traces a division error to the zero in B2 and offers a jump to that cell.\" width=\"840\" height=\"472\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-dark\" src=\"/docs/formula-error-dark.webp\" alt=\"The Formula Microscope traces a division error to the zero in B2 and offers a jump to that cell.\" width=\"840\" height=\"472\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003C/figure>\u003Ch2 id=\"match-formula-references-to-the-grid\">Match formula references to the grid\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#match-formula-references-to-the-grid\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Expand the formula bar to see each reference in a different colour. The same colour outlines its cells in the grid. Repeated references to the same range share a colour.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-where-a-pinned-result-came-from\">See where a pinned result came from\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#see-where-a-pinned-result-came-from\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Select a result and choose \u003Cstrong>Pin Result\u003C/strong> in the command palette. Click the chevron beside \u003Cstrong>Go to Cell\u003C/strong> on the floating card to show the formula, intermediate results and links to its inputs. When a source row came from a screenshot, \u003Cstrong>View Screenshot Source\u003C/strong> opens that row and its image in Scratch. Click the chevron again to return to the number.\u003C/p>\n","/docs/formula-microscope","Guides",{"title":8,"path":9},"Notes and Obsidian","/docs/notes-and-obsidian",{"title":11,"path":12},"Selection History","/docs/history"],"uses":{"params":["page"]}}]}
